WEBVTT

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:04.690
Choose Progressive.

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:08.975
It reserves an agent for every call, just like Power, but the form

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:10.701
has no Calls per agent.

00:00:10.701 --> 00:00:13.558
The dialer does not ration calls per look.

00:00:13.558 --> 00:00:17.784
It keeps going until every free agent holds a call, with a safety

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:20.462
limit of one hundred calls in one look.

00:00:20.942 --> 00:00:22.796
So the two behave alike.

00:00:22.796 --> 00:00:27.554
Power with one call per agent fills the free agents one call at a time.

00:00:27.554 --> 00:00:30.087
Progressive fills them all at once.

00:00:30.087 --> 00:00:31.879
The risks are the same:

00:00:31.879 --> 00:00:35.772
abandoned calls, and the cap on the Abandoned calls card.

